        <p class="note">
          The roll mixer itself runs on the flight controller as a Lua script: a roll PD loop
          (gains in <span class="mono">SCR_USER1</span>/<span class="mono">SCR_USER2</span>) summed
          with a ride-height offset the Pi commands on RC channel 16, output on servo functions 94
          and 95 at 20 Hz and clamped to 1000–2000 µs.
        </p>

        <div class="build-more" data-reveal>
